#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:5
msgid "Delegation and auto-reply"
msgstr "委派与自动回复"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:7
msgid ""
"Delegation is the act of sending a task to another node. This page "
"describes how a node decides which delegations to accept, how it answers "
"a text task automatically with a local agent, and what it grants to a "
"peer it trusts."
msgstr "委派是向另一节点发送任务的行为。本页说明节点如何决定接受哪些委派、如何用本地 Agent 自动回复文本任务，以及对其信任的对端授予哪些权限。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:16
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:18
msgid ""
"A task sent from one node to another is a *delegation*. The sender is the"
" *requester* and the receiving node is the *provider*. The delegation is "
"a signed and encrypted message; the hub only carries it (see :doc:`hubs` "
"and :doc:`messaging`)."
msgstr ""
"从一个节点发往另一个节点的任务称为\\ *委派*\\ （Delegation）。发送方是\\ *请求方*，接收方节点是\\ "
"*提供方*。委派是经过签名和加密的消息，Hub 只负责传递（参见 :doc:`hubs` 与 :doc:`messaging`）。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:23
msgid ""
"Every node decides for itself whom to serve. A new node accepts nothing "
"from peers that its operator has not named: the default is the most "
"restrictive setting, and every step that widens it asks for confirmation "
"on a terminal. A node that serves peers it does not know takes on three "
"risks: the cost of the work, the exposure of its machine to requests "
"written by others, and the exposure of its credentials. The settings "
"described below exist to bound each of them."
msgstr "每个节点自行决定为谁提供服务。新节点不接受运营人员未指明的对端发来的任何任务：默认值是最严格的设置，每一步放宽都需要在终端上确认。为不认识的对端提供服务的节点会承担三类风险：工作的成本、本机暴露于他人所写请求的风险，以及凭据暴露的风险。下文所述的各项设置用于限定这三类风险。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:32
msgid "Inbound policy"
msgstr "入站策略"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:34
msgid ""
"The inbound policy determines what happens to a delegation from a peer "
"that is not on any list. It has three values."
msgstr "入站策略决定来自未列入任何名单的对端的委派如何处理，有三个取值。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:37
msgid "``closed``"
msgstr "``closed``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:38
msgid ""
"The default. The node accepts tasks only from peers on its ``allow`` or "
"``trust`` list. A task from any other peer is refused."
msgstr "默认值。节点只接受 ``allow`` 或 ``trust`` 名单中对端发来的任务，其他对端的任务一律拒绝。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:41
msgid "``approve``"
msgstr "``approve``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:42
msgid ""
"A task from a peer that is on no list is held in an approval queue. It "
"does not run until the operator approves it."
msgstr "未列入任何名单的对端发来的任务进入审批队列，在运营人员批准之前不会运行。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:45
msgid "``open``"
msgstr "``open``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:46
msgid ""
"The node accepts text tasks from any peer that is not on the ``deny`` "
"list."
msgstr "节点接受任何不在 ``deny`` 名单中的对端发来的文本任务。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:48
msgid "The policy is shown and changed with ``anet inbound``."
msgstr "策略通过 ``anet inbound`` 查看和修改。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:58
msgid ""
"Setting a policy that accepts more than the current one, and approving a "
"held task, ask for confirmation on a terminal. The daemon is not able to "
"give that confirmation on behalf of the operator, so a program that only "
"reaches the node through MCP or the local A2A interface cannot widen the "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"设置比当前策略接受范围更广的策略，以及批准已挂起的任务，都需要在终端上确认。守护进程无法代替运营人员给出该确认，因此仅通过 MCP 或本地 A2A"
" 接口访问节点的程序无法放宽策略。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:64
msgid "Order of decision"
msgstr "判定顺序"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:66
msgid ""
"For each delegation the node applies the following rules in order and "
"uses the first that matches."
msgstr "对每个委派，节点按下列规则依次判定，采用第一条匹配的规则。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:69
msgid "The sender is on the ``deny`` list: refuse."
msgstr "发送方在 ``deny`` 名单中：拒绝。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:70
msgid ""
"The delegation is a call to a public capability: apply the admission "
"rules of that capability (see :doc:`capabilities`)."
msgstr "委派是对公开能力的调用：适用该能力的准入规则（参见 :doc:`capabilities`）。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:72
msgid "The sender is on the ``allow`` or ``trust`` list: accept."
msgstr "发送方在 ``allow`` 或 ``trust`` 名单中：接受。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:73
msgid ""
"The delegation is a text task and ``inbound.admit`` is set: accept when "
"the admission service admits the sender (see `Admission by a local "
"service`_)."
msgstr "委派是文本任务且设置了 ``inbound.admit``：准入服务准入发送方时接受（参见 `由本地服务准入`_）。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:75
msgid "The policy is ``approve``: hold the task in the approval queue."
msgstr "策略为 ``approve``：将任务放入审批队列。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:76
msgid ""
"The policy is ``open``: accept a text task and refuse a capability call "
"to a capability that is not public."
msgstr "策略为 ``open``：接受文本任务，拒绝对非公开能力的能力调用。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:78
msgid "Otherwise: refuse."
msgstr "其他情况：拒绝。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:80
msgid ""
"The three lists are the files ``peers.allow``, ``peers.trust`` and "
"``peers.deny`` in the data directory. Each holds one AID per line, and a "
"line that starts with ``#`` is a comment. The daemon reads them on every "
"decision, so an edit takes effect on the next message. Manage them with "
"``anet peers``:"
msgstr ""
"三个名单是数据目录中的 ``peers.allow``\\ 、\\ ``peers.trust`` 和 ``peers.deny`` "
"文件，每行一个 AID，以 ``#`` 开头的行为注释。守护进程在每次判定时读取这些文件，因此修改在下一条消息起生效。使用 ``anet "
"peers`` 管理名单："

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:93
msgid ""
"Every command takes a complete AID. A name or a prefix is not accepted, "
"because a name is chosen by its owner and a prefix can be produced by an "
"attacker. ``allow`` and ``trust`` ask for confirmation on a terminal."
msgstr ""
"每条命令都需要完整的 AID，不接受名称或前缀，因为名称由其所有者自行选定，前缀则可以被攻击者构造。\\ ``allow`` 和 "
"``trust`` 需要在终端上确认。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:97
msgid "``allow``"
msgstr "``allow``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:98
msgid "The peer may send tasks to the node."
msgstr "对端可以向节点发送任务。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:100
msgid "``trust``"
msgstr "``trust``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:101
msgid ""
"The peer may send tasks and may also cause the node's local agent to run "
"on its behalf (see `Auto-reply`_). Trust is the highest level of access "
"that a peer can hold."
msgstr "对端可以发送任务，还可以促使节点的本地 Agent 代其运行（参见 `自动回复`_）。信任是对端可以获得的最高访问级别。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:105
msgid "``deny``"
msgstr "``deny``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:106
msgid "The peer's tasks are refused and, to the peer, the refusal is final."
msgstr "对端的任务被拒绝，且对该对端而言拒绝是终局的。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:109
msgid "Admission by a local service"
msgstr "由本地服务准入"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:111
msgid ""
"A node that serves a group, such as the members of an organization, does "
"not need to keep every member on its ``allow`` list. With "
"``inbound.admit`` (since 0.3.9) the node asks a local service whether a "
"peer that is on no list may send a text task. The service is a capability"
" of the ``service`` module that its configuration marks ``\"internal\": "
"true``. Such a capability is called only by the node: it appears on no "
"card and in no registration, and a call from the network is answered as "
"for a capability that the node does not have."
msgstr ""
"为某个群体（例如一个组织的成员）提供服务的节点，无需把每个成员都列入 ``allow`` 名单。借助 ``inbound.admit``\\ （自"
" 0.3.9 起），节点会询问一个本地服务：未列入任何名单的对端是否可以发送文本任务。该服务是 ``service`` "
"模块中的一项能力，并在其配置中标记为 ``\"internal\": "
"true``。此类能力只由节点调用：它不出现在任何卡片和注册信息中，来自网络的调用按节点不具备该能力的情形应答。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:134
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The node sends ``POST`` with the header ``X-ANet-Caller`` set to the AID "
"of the peer and the body ``{}``, with the token and the backend checks of"
" the capability. The peer is admitted only when the reply is "
"``{\"admit\": true}``. Any other reply, an error, no answer within 5 "
"seconds, or a capability that the service module does not serve as "
"internal admits nobody: the decision fails closed."
msgstr ""
"节点发送 ``POST`` 请求，请求头 ``X-ANet-Caller`` 设为该对端的 AID，正文为 "
"``{}``，并沿用该能力的令牌和后端检查。只有回复为 ``{\"admit\": true}`` 时，该对端才被准入。其他任何回复、出错、5 "
"秒内无应答，或该能力未被 service 模块作为内部能力提供，均不准入任何对端：判定失败时一律按拒绝处理。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:141
msgid ""
"An admitted peer's text task is accepted as the task of a peer on the "
"``allow`` list would be, under every policy, including ``approve``. The "
"following rules apply."
msgstr "已准入对端的文本任务，在任何策略下（包括 ``approve``）都按 ``allow`` 名单中对端的任务接受。适用以下规则。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:145
msgid ""
"The ``deny`` list is read first and always takes precedence. A denied "
"peer is refused without the service being asked."
msgstr "首先读取 ``deny`` 名单，且该名单始终优先。被拒绝的对端直接被拒，不会询问服务。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:147
msgid ""
"A peer on the ``allow`` or ``trust`` list is not asked about; the lists "
"decide. Capability calls are not affected by admission."
msgstr "对 ``allow`` 或 ``trust`` 名单中的对端不进行询问，由名单决定。准入不影响能力调用。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:149
msgid ""
"Admission grants nothing else. It does not place the peer on a list, and "
"it does not change payments or trust."
msgstr "准入不授予任何其他权限：它不会把对端加入任何名单，也不改变支付或信任。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:151
msgid ""
"The decision for a peer is kept for ``cache_seconds`` (default 30, at "
"most 300), whether it admits or refuses. A question that fails is kept "
"for 5 seconds."
msgstr "对某个对端的判定，无论准入还是拒绝，都会保留 ``cache_seconds`` 秒（默认 30，最大 300）。询问失败的结果保留 5 秒。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:154
msgid ""
"The decision is made again for every owed turn, every further message on "
"the task and every delivery to an A2A backend. A peer that the service no"
" longer admits is refused once its kept decision expires: its next "
"message is dropped and its next turn is not run as an admitted peer's "
"turn."
msgstr ""
"每一个待应答的轮次、该任务的每一条后续消息，以及每一次向 A2A "
"后端的投递，都会重新判定。服务不再准入的对端，在其保留的判定过期后即被拒绝：其下一条消息被丢弃，其下一轮也不再按已准入对端的轮次运行。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:159
msgid ""
"An accepted task is recorded in the evidence event "
"``anet.delegation.received`` with ``admitted: true``. A2A backends "
"receive ``anet.admitted`` in the metadata of each task, beside "
"``anet.trusted``. How auto-reply runs an admitted peer's task is set with"
" ``auto_reply.admitted`` (see `Who is answered, and how`_). ``anet "
"status`` and ``anet inbound`` show the setting."
msgstr ""
"被接受的任务记录在证据事件 ``anet.delegation.received`` 中，并带有 ``admitted: true``。A2A "
"后端在每个任务的元数据中收到 ``anet.admitted``，与 ``anet.trusted`` 并列。自动回复如何运行已准入对端的任务，由"
" ``auto_reply.admitted`` 设置（参见 `应答对象与方式`_）。``anet status`` 和 ``anet "
"inbound`` 会显示该设置。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:166
msgid "The approval queue"
msgstr "审批队列"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:168
msgid ""
"The approval queue holds at most 200 tasks in total and 3 tasks for each "
"peer. A task that is not approved within 72 hours expires without being "
"run. These limits are constants. They protect the node, and the remedy "
"for a full queue is to process it. A requester whose task cannot be "
"queued receives ``pending_full``."
msgstr ""
"审批队列总共最多容纳 200 个任务，每个对端最多 3 个。72 "
"小时内未获批准的任务将过期，不会运行。这些限制是固定值，用于保护节点，队列已满时的处理办法是处理队列中的任务。任务无法入队的请求方会收到 "
"``pending_full``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:174
msgid "Refusals"
msgstr "拒绝"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:176
msgid ""
"A refusal costs the provider no message to the requester. The reason "
"travels in the delivery confirmation of the delegation, so the requester "
"learns it from its own node. The reasons that the inbound policy produces"
" are:"
msgstr "拒绝不会让提供方额外向请求方发送消息。原因随委派的送达确认返回，请求方从自己的节点获知。入站策略产生的原因如下："

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:180
msgid "``not_accepting``"
msgstr "``not_accepting``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:181
msgid ""
"The provider takes no tasks from the sender. The provider can run ``anet "
"peers allow <aid>``."
msgstr "提供方不接受该发送方的任务。提供方可以运行 ``anet peers allow <aid>``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:184
msgid "``denied``"
msgstr "``denied``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:185
msgid "The provider has blocked the sender. Retrying has no effect."
msgstr "提供方已屏蔽该发送方，重试无效。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:187
msgid "``capability_not_public``"
msgstr "``capability_not_public``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:188
msgid "The capability is not offered to the sender."
msgstr "该能力不向此发送方提供。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:190
msgid "``pending_approval``"
msgstr "``pending_approval``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:191
msgid "The provider holds the task for manual approval. It is not an error."
msgstr "提供方将任务挂起等待人工批准。这不是错误。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:193
msgid "``pending_full``"
msgstr "``pending_full``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:194
msgid "The approval queue of the provider is full."
msgstr "提供方的审批队列已满。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:196
msgid "``pending_expired``"
msgstr "``pending_expired``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:197
msgid "The operator did not approve the task within 72 hours."
msgstr "运营人员未在 72 小时内批准该任务。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:199
msgid ""
"The complete list, with the sentence of each code, is in :ref:`reference-"
"reason-codes`."
msgstr "完整列表及各代码对应的说明语句见 :ref:`reference-reason-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:203
msgid "Waiting for an answer"
msgstr "等待应答"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:205
msgid ""
"A requester does not wait for ever. The setting ``no_response_after`` "
"bounds two waits with one value: the time without a delivery "
"confirmation, and the time after a confirmation without any answer. When "
"the time passes, the task fails. The default is 15 minutes, and the value"
" is a duration such as ``\"15m\"``. A long-running capability needs a "
"larger value. The value ``\"0\"`` disables the deadline: an unconfirmed "
"task is then resent until it expires after 14 days, and a confirmed task "
"that the provider never answers stays open."
msgstr ""
"请求方不会无限期等待。设置项 ``no_response_after`` "
"用同一个值限定两段等待：没有送达确认的时间，以及收到确认后没有任何应答的时间。超时后任务失败。默认值为 15 分钟，取值为 ``\"15m\"``"
" 这样的时长。运行时间较长的能力需要更大的值。取值 ``\"0\"`` 表示关闭时限：未确认的任务将被重发，直至 14 "
"天后过期；已确认但提供方始终不应答的任务则保持打开。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:214
msgid "Auto-reply"
msgstr "自动回复"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:216
msgid ""
"*Auto-reply* answers text tasks without an operator. The daemon watches "
"the tasks that it has been asked to answer, calls a backend with the "
"conversation, and sends the answer as the result of the task. Auto-reply "
"is off until the operator configures it. A node with no ``auto_reply`` "
"block leaves each text task in the inbox for a person or for a coding "
"agent that the person has connected (see :ref:`howto-coding-agents`)."
msgstr ""
"*自动回复*\\ "
"无需运营人员即可回答文本任务。守护进程监视被要求应答的任务，携带对话调用后端，并将回答作为任务结果发送。运营人员配置之前，自动回复处于关闭状态。没有"
" ``auto_reply`` 配置块的节点，会把每个文本任务留在收件箱中，等待人工或人工连接的编码 Agent 处理（参见 :ref"
":`howto-coding-agents`）。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:224
msgid "Backends"
msgstr "后端"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:226
msgid "Auto-reply has two backends."
msgstr "自动回复有两种后端。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:228 ../../topics/delegation.rst:293
msgid "``openai``"
msgstr "``openai``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:229
msgid ""
"The daemon sends the conversation to a model service that implements the "
"OpenAI-compatible ``/chat/completions`` interface and sends the reply "
"back. The service can run on the same machine, or it can be a hosted "
"service. No program is started on the machine."
msgstr ""
"守护进程将对话发送到实现了 OpenAI 兼容 ``/chat/completions`` "
"接口的模型服务，并将回复送回。该服务可以运行在本机，也可以是托管服务。本机不会启动任何程序。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:234
msgid "``exec``"
msgstr "``exec``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:235
msgid ""
"The daemon starts a local coding agent for each turn and sends its final "
"output as the reply. The supported agents are ``cursor``, ``claude``, "
"``codex``, ``opencode``, ``openclaw`` and ``hermes``."
msgstr ""
"守护进程为每一轮对话启动一个本地编码 Agent，并将其最终输出作为回复发送。支持的 Agent 有 ``cursor``\\ 、\\ "
"``claude``\\ 、\\ ``codex``\\ 、\\ ``opencode``\\ 、\\ ``openclaw`` 和 "
"``hermes``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:240
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:242
msgid ""
"The backend is configured with ``anet autoreply set``. The model key is "
"read from standard input or typed on the terminal. It is never accepted "
"on the command line, because command lines are visible to other users of "
"the machine."
msgstr ""
"后端通过 ``anet autoreply set`` "
"配置。模型密钥从标准输入读取或在终端键入，从不接受命令行传入，因为同一台机器的其他用户可以看到命令行。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:255
msgid ""
"``anet autoreply test`` runs the configured backend once on the local "
"machine. It needs no hub and no identity, and the run does not count "
"against the budget described in :doc:`sandbox`. It runs every path that "
"is configured, including the sandbox path, and prints one line for each "
"path."
msgstr ""
"``anet autoreply test`` 在本机运行一次已配置的后端。它不需要 hub，也不需要身份，且该运行不计入 "
":doc:`sandbox` 所述的预算。它会运行所有已配置的路径，包括沙箱路径，并为每条路径输出一行。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:260
msgid ""
"``anet autoreply show`` prints one row for each of these subjects. The "
"rows ``trusted``, ``untrusted`` and ``budget`` appear for the ``exec`` "
"backend only, and the row ``budget`` only while the sandbox is in use."
msgstr ""
"``anet autoreply show`` 为下列每个主题输出一行。``trusted``、``untrusted`` 与 "
"``budget`` 三行只在 ``exec`` 后端出现，``budget`` 行只在使用沙箱时出现。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:272
msgid ""
"``anet autoreply set --trusted direct|sandbox`` chooses how trusted peers"
" are served. Changing from ``sandbox`` back to ``direct`` is confirmed on"
" the terminal. ``anet autoreply set --admitted off|direct|sandbox`` "
"chooses how peers that ``inbound.admit`` admits are served; turning on "
"``direct`` is confirmed on the terminal. ``anet autoreply show`` adds the"
" row ``admitted`` when the value is not ``off``. A budget of 0 is the "
"same as ``untrusted`` set to ``off``: the task stays in the inbox and the"
" requester receives no refusal."
msgstr ""
"``anet autoreply set --trusted direct|sandbox`` 选择如何服务受信任的对端。从 "
"``sandbox`` 改回 ``direct`` 需要在终端确认。``anet autoreply set --admitted "
"off|direct|sandbox`` 选择如何服务 ``inbound.admit`` 准入的对端；开启 ``direct`` "
"需要在终端确认。取值不为 ``off`` 时，``anet autoreply show`` 会增加 ``admitted`` 行。预算为 0 "
"等同于 ``untrusted`` 设为 ``off``：任务留在收件箱中，请求方不会收到拒绝。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:281
msgid ""
"The settings are stored in the ``auto_reply`` block of ``config.json``. "
"Calls to ``anet autoreply set`` merge the options that they name with the"
" current settings."
msgstr ""
"设置保存在 ``config.json`` 的 ``auto_reply`` 配置块中。\\ ``anet autoreply set`` "
"的调用会把其中指明的选项与当前设置合并。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:289
msgid "Key"
msgstr "配置键"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:290
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:291
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:292
msgid "``backend``"
msgstr "``backend``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:294
msgid "``openai`` or ``exec``."
msgstr "``openai`` 或 ``exec``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:295
msgid "``agent``"
msgstr "``agent``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:296
msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:297
msgid "The coding agent for the ``exec`` backend. Required with ``exec``."
msgstr "``exec`` 后端使用的编码 Agent。使用 ``exec`` 时必填。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:298
msgid "``untrusted``"
msgstr "``untrusted``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:299 ../../topics/delegation.rst:309
msgid "``off``"
msgstr "``off``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:300
msgid ""
"What the ``exec`` backend does for a peer that is not on the trust list: "
"``off`` leaves the task in the inbox, ``sandbox`` runs the agent in the "
"sandbox."
msgstr ""
"``exec`` 后端对不在 trust 名单中的对端的处理方式：``off`` 将任务留在收件箱，``sandbox`` 在沙箱中运行 "
"Agent。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:303
msgid "``trusted``"
msgstr "``trusted``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:304
msgid "``direct``"
msgstr "``direct``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:305
msgid ""
"How the ``exec`` backend runs for a peer on the trust list: ``direct`` "
"runs the agent as the operator's user, ``sandbox`` runs it in the "
"sandbox."
msgstr ""
"``exec`` 后端对 trust 名单中的对端的运行方式：``direct`` 以运营人员的用户身份运行 Agent，``sandbox`` "
"在沙箱中运行。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:308
msgid "``admitted``"
msgstr "``admitted``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:310
msgid ""
"How the ``exec`` backend runs for a peer that ``inbound.admit`` admits: "
"``off`` treats it as a peer that is not trusted, ``direct`` runs the "
"agent as the operator's user, ``sandbox`` runs it in the sandbox within "
"the run budget."
msgstr ""
"``exec`` 后端对 ``inbound.admit`` 准入的对端的运行方式：``off`` 按未受信任的对端处理，``direct`` "
"以运营人员的用户身份运行 Agent，``sandbox`` 在运行预算范围内于沙箱中运行。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:314
msgid "``api_base``, ``model``"
msgstr "``api_base``\\ 、\\ ``model``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:315 ../../topics/delegation.rst:318
#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:321 ../../topics/delegation.rst:337
msgid "empty"
msgstr "空"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:316
msgid "The model service address and the model name."
msgstr "模型服务的地址和模型名称。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:317
msgid "``system_prompt``"
msgstr "``system_prompt``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:319
msgid "Text placed before the conversation."
msgstr "置于对话之前的文本。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:320
msgid "``api_key``"
msgstr "``api_key``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:322
msgid "The key of the model service. It can be written and is never shown."
msgstr "模型服务的密钥。可以写入，但从不显示。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:323
msgid "``work_dir``"
msgstr "``work_dir``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:324
msgid "a directory under the data directory"
msgstr "数据目录下的一个目录"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:325
msgid "The working directory of agents that run directly."
msgstr "直接运行的 Agent 的工作目录。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:326
msgid "``command``, ``extra_args``, ``openclaw_agent``"
msgstr "``command``\\ 、\\ ``extra_args``\\ 、\\ ``openclaw_agent``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:327
msgid "the agent found on ``PATH``, none, ``main``"
msgstr "``PATH`` 中找到的 Agent、无、\\ ``main``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:328
msgid "A non-standard agent location and agent-specific arguments."
msgstr "非标准的 Agent 位置和 Agent 专用参数。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:329
msgid "``max_history``"
msgstr "``max_history``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:330
msgid "20"
msgstr "20"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:331
msgid "The number of conversation turns sent to the backend."
msgstr "发送给后端的对话轮数。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:332
msgid "``api_timeout_seconds``"
msgstr "``api_timeout_seconds``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:333
msgid "180"
msgstr "180"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:334
msgid ""
"The time limit of one backend call, and the wall-clock limit of a sandbox"
" run."
msgstr "单次后端调用的时限，以及沙箱运行的挂钟时间上限。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:336
msgid "``sandbox.egress_allow``"
msgstr "``sandbox.egress_allow``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:338
msgid "Hosts that a sandboxed agent may reach. See :doc:`sandbox`."
msgstr "沙箱中的 Agent 可以访问的主机。参见 :doc:`sandbox`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:339
msgid "``sandbox.runs_per_day``, ``sandbox.runs_per_peer_per_day``"
msgstr "``sandbox.runs_per_day``\\ 、\\ ``sandbox.runs_per_peer_per_day``"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:340
msgid "20, 5"
msgstr "20、5"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:341
msgid "The run budget for untrusted peers. See :doc:`sandbox`."
msgstr "针对未受信任对端的运行预算。参见 :doc:`sandbox`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:344
msgid "Who is answered, and how"
msgstr "应答对象与方式"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:346
msgid ""
"The ``exec`` backend decides how to run for each turn from the lists, "
"which it reads again on every turn."
msgstr "``exec`` 后端依据名单决定每一轮的运行方式，每一轮都会重新读取名单。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:349
msgid "A peer on the ``deny`` list is not answered."
msgstr "``deny`` 名单中的对端不予应答。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:350
msgid ""
"A peer on the ``trust`` list is answered according to ``trusted``. The "
"default is ``direct``. A directly run agent has the rights of the "
"operator's user, so trust in a peer is equal to giving that peer the "
"rights of the account that runs the daemon."
msgstr ""
"``trust`` 名单中的对端按 ``trusted`` 应答，默认值为 ``direct``\\ 。直接运行的 Agent "
"拥有运营人员所用账户的权限，因此信任一个对端，等同于授予该对端运行守护进程的账户的权限。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:354
msgid ""
"A peer that ``inbound.admit`` admits, and that is not on the ``trust`` "
"list, is answered according to ``admitted``. With ``direct`` the agent "
"has the rights of the operator's user, so the admission service then "
"decides who receives those rights. With ``sandbox`` the run counts "
"against the run budget. With the default ``off`` the peer is answered as "
"any other peer."
msgstr ""
"由 ``inbound.admit`` 准入且不在 ``trust`` 名单中的对端，按 ``admitted`` 应答。取值为 "
"``direct`` 时，Agent 拥有运营人员所用账户的权限，因此由准入服务决定谁获得这些权限。取值为 ``sandbox`` "
"时，该运行计入运行预算。默认值 ``off`` 下，该对端与其他对端一样应答。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:359
msgid ""
"Any other peer is answered according to ``untrusted``. The default "
"``off`` runs no program for the peer and leaves the task in the inbox. "
"The value ``sandbox`` runs the agent in the sandbox described in "
":doc:`sandbox`."
msgstr ""
"其他对端按 ``untrusted`` 应答。默认值 ``off`` 不为该对端运行任何程序，将任务留在收件箱。取值 ``sandbox`` 则在"
" :doc:`sandbox` 所述的沙箱中运行 Agent。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:363
msgid ""
"A turn that is decided as ``sandbox`` never falls back to a direct run. "
"When the sandbox is unavailable, when the budget for the day is used up, "
"or when a resource limit is exceeded, the node does not start the agent, "
"and the requester receives a refusal with the reason "
"``sandbox_unavailable`` or ``budget``."
msgstr ""
"判定为 ``sandbox`` 的一轮对话不会回退为直接运行。沙箱不可用、当日预算用尽或超出资源限制时，节点不会启动 "
"Agent，请求方收到的拒绝原因为 ``sandbox_unavailable`` 或 ``budget``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:368
msgid ""
"The ``openai`` backend starts no local program, so the choice between "
"``direct`` and ``sandbox`` does not apply. Every turn for a peer that is "
"not trusted counts against the run budget, and when the budget is used up"
" the task is refused with ``budget``."
msgstr ""
"``openai`` 后端不启动本地程序，因此 ``direct`` 与 ``sandbox`` "
"的选择不适用。针对未受信任对端的每一轮对话都计入运行预算，预算用尽后任务以 ``budget`` 拒绝。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:373
msgid ""
"A call to a capability is never answered by auto-reply. It is routed to "
"the service that provides the capability. Auto-reply handles text tasks "
"only."
msgstr "对能力的调用从不由自动回复应答，而是路由到提供该能力的服务。自动回复只处理文本任务。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:376
msgid ""
"When the backend completes the task, the daemon sends the final reply as "
"part of the result, together with a receipt signed by the provider, and "
"the task ends. Otherwise the conversation continues in further messages, "
"with a limit of 30 automatic replies for each task. When the backend "
"fails, the requester receives the standard ``backend_failed`` sentence "
"and no text from the backend."
msgstr ""
"后端完成任务后，守护进程将最终回复连同提供方签名的回执作为结果的一部分发送，任务结束。否则对话以后续消息继续，每个任务最多自动回复 30 "
"次。后端失败时，请求方收到标准的 ``backend_failed`` 说明语句，不包含后端的任何文本。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:383
msgid "Requesting a delegation"
msgstr "发起委派"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:385
msgid ""
"The requester side uses the same concepts. A text task is sent with "
"``anet delegate`` and a capability call with the ``--capability`` option."
msgstr "请求方使用同样的概念。文本任务用 ``anet delegate`` 发送，能力调用则加上 ``--capability`` 选项。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:397
msgid ""
"``anet delegate`` returns the task at once. The task then moves through "
"the A2A states ``submitted``, ``working``, ``input-required`` and a final"
" state. ``anet task get`` shows the state, and ``anet inbox`` and ``anet "
"results`` list the tasks that others sent to the node and the tasks the "
"node sent that have ended. Receipts and the final text are verified "
"before they are shown as verified. See :doc:`messaging` for delivery "
"confirmation and :doc:`payments` for tasks that ask for payment."
msgstr ""
"``anet delegate`` 立即返回任务。此后任务依次经过 A2A 状态 ``submitted``\\ 、\\ "
"``working``\\ 、\\ ``input-required`` 和一个终态。\\ ``anet task get`` "
"显示任务状态；``anet inbox`` 和 ``anet results`` "
"分别列出他人发给本节点的任务，以及本节点发出且已结束的任务。回执和最终文本经验证后才会显示为已验证。送达确认参见 "
":doc:`messaging`，要求付款的任务参见 :doc:`payments`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:406
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:408
msgid ""
"The default configuration accepts no work from strangers and starts no "
"program on behalf of a peer. Each widening is an explicit step on a "
"terminal."
msgstr "默认配置不接受陌生人的任何工作，也不代表对端启动任何程序。每一次放宽都是在终端上显式进行的步骤。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:410
msgid ""
"``open`` makes the node reachable by everyone for text tasks. Combine it "
"with ``approve`` or with an ``untrusted`` value of ``off`` unless the "
"node runs on a machine that holds nothing of value."
msgstr ""
"``open`` 使节点对所有人的文本任务开放。除非节点所在机器上没有任何有价值的内容，否则应与 ``approve`` 或取值为 ``off``"
" 的 ``untrusted`` 配合使用。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:413
msgid ""
"``trust`` is bound to an AID. An identity keeps its AID when its keys are"
" rotated, so the trust stays in place until the operator removes it."
msgstr "``trust`` 绑定到 AID。身份在轮换密钥后保持其 AID 不变，因此信任一直有效，直至运营人员将其移除。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:415
msgid ""
"The lists are plain files with the permissions ``0600``. Anyone who can "
"write them can change the policy, so the data directory must be readable "
"only by its owner."
msgstr "名单是权限为 ``0600`` 的普通文件。能够写入这些文件的人可以更改策略，因此数据目录必须仅对其所有者可读。"

#: ../../topics/delegation.rst:418
msgid ""
"The control token of the daemon is also a credential. A local program "
"that holds it can run an agent in the same way as the operator can."
msgstr "守护进程的控制令牌同样是一种凭据。持有该令牌的本地程序可以像运营人员一样运行 Agent。"

